  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Inspecting PDF Content**\n\nI\'m now diving into the `public/assets/aistudio/` directory. I\'m using Node within a TypeScript environment to inspect the text content of the PDFs. Currently, I\'m focused on extracting the text from `005._HKI_Buku_Ajar_Farmakologi_2022_4237e242.pdf` and `kupdf.net_farmakologi-dan-terapi-edisi-4_991d.pdf`. The async IIFE seems to be working, and I\'m eager to see what data emerges.\n\n\n"
