  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Discovery**\n\nI\'m struck by the speed and clarity of that initial result! Now, my focus is on unpacking the meaning of this. I\'m starting by examining HKI 2022, specifically \"Buku Ajar Farmakologi\" by Dr. Siti Maemonah et al. from Zahir Publishing. I\'m keen to grasp the nuances here.\n\n\n**Mapping the Scope**\n\nI\'m now cataloging the core structure. The initial focus on HKI 2022 is clarifying into a chapter-by-chapter assessment, I see a good foundation of topics there! I\'m also cross-referencing with *Farmakologi dan Terapi Edisi 4*. It presents a much broader scope, but it\'s important to keep track of both, their Seksi and Bab respectively. This is getting rather expansive now.\n\n\n**Expanding the Context**\n\nI\'m now recalibrating my approach based on resource location and file structure. My initial expectation of pre-populated markdown files in `knowledge_books/` was incorrect, necessitating a shift to directly process the PDFs in `public/assets/aistudio/`. I\'m starting by inspecting HKI 2022\'s relevant chapters via `/tmp/hki2022.json`, particularly Bab I, V, and VI, to inform how I structure the generated Markdown files.\n\n\n"
