  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\nThe user requested two main tasks for the **Ruang Obat** React + Express/Gemini educational pharmacy web app:\n1. **Replace all placeholder texts** (`\"Materi sedang dalam proses validasi pakar.\"` and `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` strings) across components and data files (including Pustaka, Cek Label, Kamus, Panduan Simpan/Buang, PDF generator, etc.) by filling in actual, accurate educational material directly referenced from **HKI 2022** (*Buku Ajar Farmakologi*, 2022) and **Farmakologi & Terapi Edisi 4** (FKUI, Sulistia G. Ganiswarna ed.).\n2. **Lock & upgrade AI Chat (`server.ts`, `server/knowledgeBase.ts`, `src/components/ChatbotWidget.tsx`)** so that:\n   - The `knowledge_books/` directory contains the **35 markdown book files** from HKI 2022 and Farmakologi & Terapi Ed. 4.\n   - The AI system instruction and `knowledgeBase.ts` retrieval strictly prioritize and cite sources from those 35 book files in `knowledge_books/`.\n   - Every AI response explicitly displays the source book name and chapter (`nama buku` / `bab buku`).\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed (Inspection & Caching Only \342\200\224 No App Source Files Modified Yet)\n- **Skill Check completed**: Read `/skills/system_skills/gemini_api/SKILL.md` (full 687 lines). Key rules noted: use `@google/genai` server-side only, `User-Agent: \'aistudio-build\'`, valid models `gemini-4-hydrogen` (with `ThinkingLevel` enum, no deprecated sampling params) / `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`, `chat.sendMessageStream({ message })`, `chunk.text` property.\n- **Full Placeholder Audit completed** via `grep` and `view_file`:\n  - `src/components/ui/RujukanText.tsx` (lines 14-27): Checks `text.trim().startsWith(\'[ISI DARI RUJUKAN\')` and renders `\"Materi sedang dalam proses validasi pakar.\"`.\n  - `src/data/labelHotspots.ts`: Contains 54 `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` strings across `tablet` (6 hotspots \303\227 3 fields: `meaning`, `tips`, `warning`), `sirup` (6 \303\227 3), and `salep` (6 \303\227 3).\n  - `src/data/kamusData.ts`: Contains 18 `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` strings in `definition` across 18 `KAMUS_ITEMS`.\n  - `src/data/panduanSimpanBuang.ts`: Contains 28 `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` strings across 4 sediaan (`Tablet`, `Sirup / Cair`, `Salep / Krim / Gel`, `Tetes Mata / Telinga` \342\200\224 3 `simpanRules`, 3 `buangRules`, 1 `catatanPenting` each).\n  - `src/data/pustakaData.ts`: Contains 10 `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` strings (`judul` and `tautanPlaceholder` for `ref-1`..`ref-5`). Also should include HKI 2022 & Farmakologi dan Terapi Ed. 4!\n  - `src/utils/generatePdfClient.ts` (line 220): Contains `\'Semua uraian medis mengacu pada rujukan resmi BPOM RI, Kemenkes RI, dan Farmakope Indonesia yang masih dalam proses validasi pakar.\'`\n  - `DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.md` (line 33): Mentions `\"Materi sedang dalam proses validasi pakar.\"`\n  - `src/views/LatihanPreviewView.tsx` (line 142): Unused legacy preview file containing `[URL PLACEHOLDER GOOGLE FORM]` (not imported by `App.tsx`, verify whether to clean up).\n- **Inspected AI Chat & Server files**:\n  - `server/knowledgeBase.ts` (462 lines)\n  - `server.ts` (322 lines)\n  - `src/components/ChatbotWidget.tsx` (956 lines)\n  - `src/views/PustakaView.tsx`, `src/views/CekLabelView.tsx`, `src/views/LemariView.tsx`, `src/views/LatihanView.tsx`, `src/views/BerandaView.tsx`, `src/components/KamusModal.tsx`, `src/components/PanduanSimpanBuangModal.tsx`, `src/components/TinjauDosenModal.tsx`, `src/components/TentangModal.tsx`, `src/components/FooterDisclaimer.tsx`, `src/App.tsx`, `src/data/latihanData.ts`, `src/data/identitasProyek.ts`, `src/data/initialMedicines.ts`, `package.json`.\n- **Extracted Full Source Books to JSON Cache in `/tmp/`**:\n  - `knowledge_books/` currently ONLY contains `README.txt` and empty `uploads/`. The 35 markdown files do NOT exist yet on disk, while the full PDFs sit in `public/assets/aistudio/`.\n  - Extracted **HKI 2022** (`public/assets/aistudio/005._HKI_Buku_Ajar_Farmakologi_2022_4237e242.pdf`, 270 pages) to `/tmp/hki2022.json`.\n  - Extracted **Farmakologi dan Terapi Edisi 4** (`public/assets/aistudio/kupdf.net_farmakologi-dan-terapi-edisi-4_991d8e3d.pdf`, 1146 pages) to `/tmp/fkui_ed4.json`.\n  - Temporary files `/tmp/hki_selected_1.txt` and `/tmp/hki_selected_2.txt` were also created earlier in `/tmp/`.\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n1. **HKI 2022 Structure** (*Buku Ajar Farmakologi*, Dr. Siti Maemonah dkk., Zahir Publishing, Cetakan I Agustus 2022, ISBN 978-623-466-100-2, 270 PDF pages, **11 Bab**):\n   - Bab I (PDF p.9-24): Konsep Dasar Farmakologi (Dr. Siti Maemonah) \342\200\224 definitions, scope (farmakognosi, biofarmasi, toksikologi, farmakovigilans), perundang-undangan obat, sources, composition, potency, safety, individual variability.\n   - Bab II (PDF p.25-34): Farmakokinetik\n   - Bab III (PDF p.35-54): Farmakodinamika\n   - Bab IV (PDF p.55-72): Farmakoterapi\n   - Bab V (PDF p.73-100): Toksikologi\n   - Bab VI (PDF p.101-116): Peran Obat\n   - Bab VII (PDF p.117-132): Penggolongan Jenis Obat (Alfi Maziyah) \342\200\224 Permenkes 917/1993 & 949/2000, Obat Bebas (lingkaran hijau), Obat Bebas Terbatas Daftar W (lingkaran biru + P.No. 1-6, 5\303\2272 cm kotak hitam), Obat Keras Daftar G (lingkaran merah huruf K + OWA), Psikotropika (Gol I-IV), Narkotika (Gol I-III), mekanisme kerja, lokasi pemakaian (dalam/luar), efek (sistemik/lokal), asal obat.\n   - Bab VIII (PDF p.133-174): Prinsip Pemberian Obat Dengan Benar \342\200\224 legal/hak pasien, klasifikasi obat, rute pemberian (oral, sublingual/bukal, parenteral, topikal, rektal, inhalasi), waktu pemberian, penyimpanan/kedaluwarsa, interaksi susu/makanan/antasida.\n   - Bab IX (PDF p.175-192): Bentuk Sediaan Obat (Apt. Teguh Adiyas Putra) \342\200\224 padat (tablet, kapsul, pil), cair (larutan, eliksir, sirup, emulsi, guttae, suspensi \"kocok perlahan\"), semi padat (salep, pasta, krim M/A & A/M, gel), injeksi, gas/uap.\n   - Bab X (PDF p.193-212): Peran Perawat Dalam Pemberian Obat (includes Benar Waktu, Benar Dosis, Benar Cara/Rute).\n   - Bab XI (PDF p.213-270): Cara Pemberian Obat (prosedur oral, tablet/kapsul tidak disentuh tangan langsung, sirup/suspensi kocok perlahan + tutup terbalik + skala miniskus, sublingual, bukal, topikal, mata, telinga, dll.).\n2. **Farmakologi dan Terapi Edisi 4 Structure** (FKUI, Ed. Utama Sulistia G. Ganiswarna, 1995/cetak ulang 2001, ISBN 979-496-112-4, 56 chapters across 17 Seksi):\n   - **Important**: In `kupdf.net_farmakologi-dan-terapi-edisi-4_991d8e3d.pdf` (1146 pages), some pages are out-of-order/repeated at the back (e.g., pages 885-1146 duplicate sections like Bab 20-24, Bab 39-46, Bab 52-53; TOC is on PDF p.18-20). When splitting FKUI Ed. 4 into markdown files, deduplicate/verify page ranges by chapter number & printed page number so content isn\'t duplicated or missing!\n   - Key FKUI Ed. 4 chapters relevant to Ruang Obat content:\n     - Bab 1 (PDF p.22-44): Pengantar Farmakologi (absorpsi, bioavailabilitas, lintas pertama, rute oral/sublingual/rektal, efek samping, dll.)\n     - Bab 15: Analgesik-Antipiretik, AINS, Obat Pirai (parasetamol, aspirin, ibuprofen)\n     - Bab 18: Histamin dan Antialergi\n     - Bab 33 (PDF p.374-390): Adrenokortikotropin & Adrenokortikosteroid (termasuk efek samping steroid topikal/sistemik)\n     - Bab 34 (PDF p.556-576): Obat Lokal (Azalia Arif & Udin Sjamsudin \342\200\224 antasida, digestan, pencahar, antiseptik/obat lokal kulit & selaput lendir)\n     - Bab 38 (PDF p.614-625): Obat Jamur\n     - Bab 39 (PDF p.626-638): Pengantar Antimikroba (resistensi antimikroba, prinsip pemakaian antibiotik, sebab kegagalan terapi)\n     - Bab 52 (PDF p.816-834): Dasar Toksikologi (dosis vs racun, efek samping, keracunan)\n     - Bab 54 (PDF p.854-864): Interaksi Obat\n     - Bab 56 (PDF p.874-884): Faktor-faktor yang Mempengaruhi Respons Penderita Terhadap Obat (usia, dosis, penyakit hati/ginjal, toleransi)\n3. **Why \"35 file buku di `knowledge_books`\"**:\n   - HKI 2022 has **11 Bab** -> 11 `.md` files.\n   - Farmakologi & Terapi Ed. 4 can be split into **24 `.md` files** (17 Seksi or major Bab groupings covering all chapters cleanly) -> `11 + 24 = 35` `.md` files inside `knowledge_books/`!\n   - Also check `server/knowledgeBase.ts`:\n     - Currently `knowledgeQuota` only pulls `Math.min(4, maxTotal)` book chunks and balances with `websiteChunks` (`maxTotal = 8`). The user explicitly asked to **lock** system instructions and `knowledgeBase.ts` to **prioritize and strictly cite from the 35 book files in `knowledge_books`**, and **display the book name / chapter in every AI response**.\n     - `knowledgeBase.ts` should parse markdown headings/frontmatter/metadata (`bookTitle` + `chapterTitle` e.g. `HKI 2022: Buku Ajar Farmakologi \342\200\224 Bab VII: Penggolongan Jenis Obat` or `Farmakologi & Terapi Ed. 4 (FKUI) \342\200\224 Bab 34: Obat Lokal`) so `sourceName` and `sectionTitle` cleanly represent the **Nama Buku** and **Bab Buku** (and page/sub-bab), NOT raw messy chunk labels.\n     - `ChatbotWidget.tsx` currently renders `{src.sectionTitle}` inside pills (and only shows `max-w-[190px]` truncated!). We should ensure both the AI response text itself (enforced via `systemInstruction` to always include a \"Sumber Rujukan:\" / inline citation mentioning exact Book Name & Chapter) AND the UI source badges in `ChatbotWidget.tsx` clearly display `bookName` & `chapterTitle` (`src.sourceName` + `src.sectionTitle`) for every answer!\n     - Also update `ChatbotWidget.tsx` copy where it still assumes `.zip` upload is needed (\"Materi Web & Buku (.zip)\", \"Aktif: ... Siap tambah .zip buku\") if 35 books are now pre-loaded, while preserving upload/reload functionality gracefully.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- **`npx tsx -e` Top-level await error**: `tsx -e` defaults to CJS; wrap async inline scripts in `(async () => { ... })()` or write a script / use `node -e` on JSON caches.\n- **Slow full-PDF extraction**: Extracting `kupdf.net_farmakologi-dan-terapi-edisi-4_991d8e3d.pdf` (82MB, 1146 pages) takes ~35s via `unpdf`; **already solved** by extracting both PDFs once to `/tmp/hki2022.json` and `/tmp/fkui_ed4.json`. Do NOT re-parse the giant PDFs unless extracting specific missing info; read `/tmp/hki2022.json` and `/tmp/fkui_ed4.json` directly with `node -e`!\n- **`view_file` outside workspace**: `view_file` rejects paths like `/tmp/...`. Only use `view_file` for paths under `/app/applet` (starting with `/src/...`, `/server/...`, `/knowledge_books/...`). Use `run_command` (`node -e`) to inspect `/tmp/*.json`.\n- **Two background tasks (`task-95`, `task-96`)** already finished and delivered output; `task-90` already finished (`DONE fkui_ed4: 1146`). No tasks are currently running.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Cached extracted PDF page arrays ready to use:\n  - `/tmp/hki2022.json` (270 pages)\n  - `/tmp/fkui_ed4.json` (1146 pages)\n- Dev server dependencies are already installed (`unpdf`, `jszip`, `@google/genai@^3.3.0`, `lucide-react`, `recharts`, `jspdf`, `vite`).\n- Note `package.json` `@google/genai` is `^3.3.0`, and `server.ts` already imports `{ GoogleGenAI, ThinkingLevel, type Content, type GenerateContentResponse } from \'@google/genai\'`.\n\n## 6. Next Steps (In Priority Order)\n1. **Generate the 35 Markdown book files in `/knowledge_books/`**:\n   - Inspect `/tmp/fkui_ed4.json` printed page headers/page numbers (`1`..`863`) to cleanly reconstruct all 56 chapters in canonical order without duplicates from the malformed PDF tail.\n   - Write a Node script (remove script afterwards or keep clean) that outputs **exactly 35 `.md` files** in `/knowledge_books/`:\n     - 11 files for **HKI 2022 (Buku Ajar Farmakologi)** (`HKI_2022_Bab_01_*.md` through `HKI_2022_Bab_11_*.md`), each starting with a clean header:\n       `# Buku Ajar Farmakologi (HKI, 2022)` and `## Bab X: <Judul Bab> (<Penulis>)`.\n     - 24 files for **Farmakologi dan Terapi Edisi 4 (FKUI)** (`FKUI_Ed4_01_*.md` through `FKUI_Ed4_24_*.md`) grouping the 17 Seksi / 56 Bab cleanly (keeping Bab 1, Bab 15, Bab 18, Bab 33, Bab 34, Bab 38, Bab 39, Bab 52, Bab 54, Bab 56 easily distinguishable with `## Bab ...` markdown headings inside each file!).\n   - Verify via `ls knowledge_books/*.md | wc -l` that there are **35** `.md` files (excluding `README.txt` and `uploads/`).\n2. **Read specific relevant sections** from `/tmp/hki2022.json` and `/tmp/fkui_ed4.json` (especially HKI Bab I, V, VII, VIII, IX, XI; FKUI Bab 1, 15, 33, 34, 38, 39, 52, 54, 56; and optionally quick spot-check on `Farmakope_Indonesia_Ed_VI_2020_2bb847df.pdf` / `Buku_dosis_Obat_IDAI_37748c57.pdf` only if needed for Pustaka details) so all replaced material is 100% grounded in the books.\n3. **Replace all `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` & `\"Materi sedang dalam proses validasi pakar.\"` placeholders**:\n   - `src/data/pustakaData.ts`: Replace all 5 `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` `judul` and `tautanPlaceholder` entries with verified official citations/URLs, and add entries for **Buku Ajar Farmakologi (HKI, 2022)** (Siti Maemonah dkk., Zahir Publishing, ISBN 978-623-466-100-2) and **Farmakologi dan Terapi Edisi 4** (Sulistia G. Ganiswarna dkk., Bagian Farmakologi FKUI, ISBN 979-496-112-4). Also ensure `PustakaView.tsx` renders clickable/clean links or references nicely without placeholder wording.\n   - `src/data/labelHotspots.ts`: Replace all 54 `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` fields (`meaning`, `tips`, `warning` for Tablet, Sirup, Salep) with detailed, accurate educational explanations citing HKI 2022 (Bab VII, VIII, IX, XI) & Farmakologi & Terapi Ed. 4 (Bab 1, 33, 34, 38, 39, 52, 54) plus BPOM/Kemenkes/Farmakope standards.\n   - `src/data/kamusData.ts`: Replace all 18 `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` `definition` fields with clear, accurate definitions citing HKI 2022 / Farmakologi & Terapi Ed. 4 / BPOM / Kemenkes / Farmakope.\n   - `src/data/panduanSimpanBuang.ts`: Replace all 28 `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN: ...]` strings (`simpanRules`, `buangRules`, `catatanPenting`) with complete, practical guidance grounded in HKI 2022 (Bab VIII, IX, XI) & Kemenkes/BPOM DAGUSIBU.\n   - `src/components/ui/RujukanText.tsx`: Remove the `\"Materi sedang dalam proses validasi pakar.\"` fallback (or render clean text / remove `[ISI DARI RUJUKAN...]` handling since none remain, while safely rendering text).\n   - `src/utils/generatePdfClient.ts` (line 220) & `DOKUMEN_PROTOTIPE_SKRIPSI.md` (line 33): Update wording to remove `\"masih dalam proses validasi pakar\"` / `\"Materi sedang dalam proses validasi pakar.\"` and state that materials are grounded in official regulations and farmakologi textbooks (HKI 2022, Farmakologi & Terapi Ed. 4, BPOM RI, Kemenkes RI, Farmakope Indonesia).\n   - Check `src/views/LatihanPreviewView.tsx` (confirm if unused; remove `[URL PLACEHOLDER GOOGLE FORM]` if present so zero placeholders exist anywhere).\n   - Run `grep` across `src/` and `server/` to guarantee **zero** remaining instances of `validasi pakar` or `ISI DARI RUJUKAN` or `PLACEHOLDER`.\n4. **Lock & Upgrade RAG + AI Chat (`server/knowledgeBase.ts`, `server.ts`, `src/components/ChatbotWidget.tsx`)**:\n   - In `server/knowledgeBase.ts`:\n     - Parse `.md` files in `knowledge_books/` smartly: split by `## Bab` / markdown headings when creating chunks, and extract clean `bookName` (e.g., `HKI 2022: Buku Ajar Farmakologi` or `Farmakologi & Terapi Ed. 4 (FKUI)`) + `chapterTitle` (e.g., `Bab VII: Penggolongan Jenis Obat`) into `sourceName` and `sectionTitle` (and optionally add `bookName` and `chapterTitle` fields to `KnowledgeChunk` & `BookSourceMeta`).\n     - Update `retrieveRelevantChunks(query, maxTotal = 10)`: **strictly prioritize book chunks** from `knowledge_books` (e.g., allocate primary slots\342\200\224say 7\342\200\2238 out of 10 chunks\342\200\224to top matching chunks from the 35 `knowledge_books` files, only adding 1\342\200\2232 website chunks if specifically about app navigation/features like Lemari Obat/Cek Label or when `bookChunks` don\'t cover UI usage; boost exact keyword/chapter matches and multi-token overlap in book titles/chapters/text).\n   - In `server.ts` (`/api/chat`):\n     - Build `booksOverview` cleanly listing the 35 indexed book files grouped by book (`Buku Ajar Farmakologi HKI 2022` & `Farmakologi dan Terapi Edisi 4 FKUI`) + chapter list.\n     - Rewrite `systemInstruction` so it **strictly locks** the assistant to:\n       1. Prioritize and rely strictly on the 35 reference book files in `knowledge_books/` (plus website context only for Ruang Obat app features). Never invent facts or cite external sources outside the loaded context.\n       2. **Mandatory citation in EVERY answer**: Always state the exact **Nama Buku** and **Bab Buku** used (both inline where appropriate and in a dedicated `**Sumber Buku:**` section at the bottom of every response).\n       3. Maintain strict patient safety rules (no personal dosing calculation, no personal medical diagnosis, red flags -> refer to pharmacist/doctor).\n       4. If a topic is not found in the 35 loaded books/website context, state honestly that it is not covered in the loaded reference books.\n     - Include `bookName` / `chapterTitle` (`sourceName`, `sectionTitle`) in the `done` SSE `sources` payload (include all actually retrieved book sources, prioritizing `sourceType === \'book\'`).\n   - In `src/components/ChatbotWidget.tsx`:\n     - Update header/tab status & starter prompts to reflect the **35 Buku Referensi Aktif (HKI 2022 & Farmakologi dan Terapi Ed. 4)** (`Aktif: 35 Buku Referensi + Isi Website`), cleanly list all 35 files in the \"Sumber Buku\" panel with readable book/chapter titles.\n     - Update the citation chips under every AI response to show a clear **\"Sumber Buku & Bab:\"** badge list displaying **both** the book name (`src.sourceName`) and chapter (`src.sectionTitle`) cleanly without overly tight truncation (`max-w-[190px]` -> readable wrap/full badge).\n5. **Cleanup & Verification**:\n   - Delete temporary `/tmp/hki2022.json`, `/tmp/fkui_ed4.json`, `/tmp/hki_selected_*.txt` (and any temporary helper scripts created in the project).\n   - Test `knowledgeBase.reload()` / retrieval via a quick node check to verify all 35 `.md` files load fast, chunk counts > 0, and retrieval returns exact HKI 2022 / FKUI Ed. 4 book + chapter metadata.\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` in the same final verification turn (max 3 fix attempts if any TS/Vite issues appear).\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Follow `/skills/system_skills/gemini_api/SKILL.md` strictly (keep `@google/genai` server-side only, use `gemini-4-hydrogen` / `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` with `ThinkingLevel` enum, no deprecated sampling parameters, `User-Agent: \'aistudio-build\'`).\n- Maintain Ruang Obat\'s patient-safety ethics: pure general education, NO personal dose calculator, NO medical diagnosis, always encourage pharmacist/doctor consultation for personal medical conditions.\n- Never fabricate citations or regulatory claims outside the reference texts and official Indonesian standards.\n- Keep responses concise and scannable upon final completion (no internal file paths or step IDs exposed unnecessarily).\n</summary>"
