  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Discovering the PDF Flaw**\n\nI\'ve made a crucial breakthrough! I\'ve realized that the `unpdf` tool merges lines with double spaces instead of newlines, which explains why `.split(\"\\n\")` failed. I\'m now testing two viable solutions: splitting on the regex `/\\s{2,}/` and extracting page numbers & headers per page. Mapping every PDF page seems to be a reliable start!\n\n\n"
    message_id: "z2ACa5flJ-yFjrEPncu_uQs"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2056196576839868200"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"node -e \'\\nconst fs = require(\\\"fs\\\");\\nconst fkui = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(\\\"/tmp/fkui_ed4.json\\\", \\\"utf8\\\"));\\nconst map = [];\\nfor (let i = 0; i < fkui.length; i++) {\\n  const txt = fkui[i].replace(/\\\\s+/g, \\\" \\\").trim();\\n  const head = txt.slice(0, 140);\\n  // Look for printed page number near start: e.g. \\\"24 Farmakologi dan Terapi\\\" or \\\"Title 247\\\"\\n  let pnum = null;\\n  const m1 = head.match(/^(\\\\d{1,3})\\\\s+Farmakologi/i);\\n  const m2 = head.match(/\\\\b(\\\\d{1,3})\\\\b/);\\n  if (m1) pnum = parseInt(m1[1], 10);\\n  else if (m2 && head.indexOf(m2[1]) < 60) pnum = parseInt(m2[1], 10);\\n  map.push({ pdf: i+1, pnum, head: head.slice(0, 85) });\\n}\\n// Print transitions or every 20 pages, plus any chapter/seksi markers\\nfor (let i = 0; i < map.length; i++) {\\n  const m = map[i];\\n  const prev = i > 0 ? map[i-1] : null;\\n  const jump = prev && m.pnum && prev.pnum && Math.abs(m.pnum - prev.pnum) > 2;\\n  const isChap = /(SEKSI\\\\s+[IVX]+|\\\\b[IVX]{1,4}\\\\.\\\\s+[A-Z]{4,}|\\\\b\\\\d{1,2}\\\\.\\\\s+[A-Z]{4,}|Indeks\\\\b|Daftar\\\\s+lsi)/i.test(m.head);\\n  if (i < 25 || jump || isChap || i === 884 || i === 885) {\\n    console.log(`PDF ${String(m.pdf).padStart(4)} | p.${String(m.pnum||\\\"?\\\").padStart(3)} | ${m.head}`);\\n  }\\n}\\n\'\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":5000, \"toolAction\":\"Mapping all FKUI Ed 4 PDF pages to printed pages\", \"toolSummary\":\"Map FKUI Ed 4 PDF to printed pages\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\352\003\n\347\003\001i\024}\023(\257f1\302\215r\320_\'A\255R\316\377\254\236\272\364Ge0}-\370\"\246\305\213*(\a\347\ftJ\035\327\274a\016\005\nc\2108\315\335\033g%\242\347x\323\313\235\236PcX\373\034\3756V\261\343\234\345Y&\016\340\276\367\032\026\226\016\230\214\371\0208\327t\t\370\022V$FN\vh\030\016\031 \306U\022\374\221o\aT\as\306:\367*$\206\330P2K\2214\357\371\375 \265n\377G\016\262$!B|\345\006\322Co\301\336V\024\303\233.\353\213\'\327$\355C\270IL\344lZ\327\r0\t=\374\272\031P\032(\242C\376\036\210,|\250\3732\225\374(\361\331}\246\f\266\374\257\346\364\331n\023\261\326\253X[\301-!\006\205\f\'[/N\267{G\270`\304\214K\221\335yI\336\242\b\035Q\025\272\241\355\305Fxbf\032\256\343\273o\276\026.\220\307\2428\371\025^\231@0\263C\303Ll\025\262\255\245v\033\020`\333\304\247~\277\002\266k&@\353t\3705$\304\333\227q\256=\341\224\034\356XC\023:\363f\n\003\226>\205@\251\302\000\356K\0317a\0026+\v\263\264\276\021\b\350n\370\006M\256\371\020 \210\353#Rg\333\363vc\257\222\371#\215\027)y\003\271\262\212R)\022\2044\326\022;\322\252I\301\346\341k\333\301j\253\344\325\246\213\256Ij\345\360\303g\232\331\231c\374?w\352\321\373\202\261\v\317h\210\236\222.\002\005\247\306\272y\3764\230\261\005\272\252S\201\323\344\270dW\225_\016\\\2305\303\036$C\251\205j\274\027\354=K\233\t\3575s\344\247\227[\237(\320\363\306\235Dvj\225\340\334\273\333w\330\'\311s\256\213\3031\245\206\204\021dj\223\023K"
