enisilin, Sefalosporin, dan Antibiotik Betalaktam Lainnya\",\n    sections: [\n      { heading: \"Bab 43: Penisilin, Sefalosporin, dan Antibiotik Betalaktam Lainnya (Seksi XII)\", start: 677, end: 704 }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    file: \"FKUI_Ed4_19_Tetrasiklin_Aminoglikosida_Lainnya_Bab_44_sd_46.md\",\n    title: \"Seksi XII \342\200\224 Bab 44\342\200\22346: Tetrasiklin, Kloramfenikol, Aminoglikosida, Antimikroba Lain\",\n    sections: [\n      { heading: \"Bab 44: Golongan Tetrasiklin dan Kloramfenikol (Seksi XII)\", start: 705, end: 714 },\n      { heading: \"Bab 45: Aminoglikosid (Seksi XII)\", start: 715, end: 728 },\n      { heading: \"Bab 46: Antimikroba Lain (Seksi XII)\", start: 729, end: 739 }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    file: \"FKUI_Ed4_20_Antikanker_dan_Imunosupresan_Bab_47_sd_48.md\",\n    title: \"Seksi XIII \342\200\224 Bab 47\342\200\22348: Antikanker dan Imunosupresan\",\n    sections: [\n      { heading: \"Bab 47: Antikanker (Seksi XIII)\", start: 740, end: 755 },\n      { heading: \"Bab 48: Imunosupresan (Seksi XIII)\", start: 756, end: 767 }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    file: \"FKUI_Ed4_21_Vitamin_Mineral_dan_Hematologik_Bab_49_sd_51.md\",\n    title: \"Seksi XIV\342\200\223XV \342\200\224 Bab 49\342\200\22351: Vitamin, Mineral, Antianemia, Antikoagulan & Hemostatik\",\n    sections: [\n      { heading: \"Bab 49: Vitamin dan Mineral (Seksi XIV)\", start: 768, end: 791 },\n      { heading: \"Bab 50: Antianemia Defisiensi (Seksi XV)\", start: 792, end: 800 },\n      { heading: \"Bab 51: Antikoagulan, Antitrombosit, Trombolitik, dan Hemostatik (Seksi XV)\", start: 801, end: 815 }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    file: \"FKUI_Ed4_22_Dasar_Toksikologi_dan_Logam_Berat_Bab_52_sd_53.md\",\n    title: \"Seksi XVI \342\200\224 Bab 52\342\200\22353: Dasar Toksikologi & Logam Berat dan Antagonis\",\n    sections: [\n      { heading: \"Bab 52: Dasar Toksikologi (Seksi XVI)\", start: 816, end: 834 },\n      { heading: \"Bab 53: Logam Berat dan Antagonis (Seksi XVI)\", start: 835, end: 853 }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    file: \"FKUI_Ed4_23_Interaksi_Obat_dan_Farmakokinetik_Klinik_Bab_54_sd_55.md\",\n    title: \"Seksi XVII \342\200\224 Bab 54\342\200\22355: Interaksi Obat & Farmakokinetik Klinik\",\n    sections: [\n      { heading: \"Bab 54: Interaksi Obat (Seksi XVII)\", start: 854, end: 864 },\n      { heading: \"Bab 55: Farmakokinetik Klinik (Seksi XVII)\", start: 865, end: 873 }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    file: \"FKUI_Ed4_24_Faktor_Respons_Penderita_Bab_56.md\",\n    title: \"Seksi XVII \342\200\224 Bab 56: Faktor-Faktor yang Mempengaruhi Respons Penderita Terhadap Obat\",\n    sections: [\n      { heading: \"Bab 56: Faktor-faktor yang Mempengaruhi Respons Penderita Terhadap Obat (Seksi XVII)\", start: 874, end: 884 }\n    ]\n  }\n];\n\nfor (const f of fkuiFiles) {\n  const parts = [\n    `# Farmakologi dan Terapi Edisi 4 (FKUI)`,\n    ``,\n    `**Referensi:** Farmakologi dan Terapi Edisi 4 \342\200\224 Editor Utama Sulistia G. Ganiswarna (Bagian Farmakologi Fakultas Kedokteran Universitas Indonesia, Jakarta, ISBN 979-496-112-4)`,\n    `**Cakupan:** ${f.title}`,\n    ``\n  ];\n  let prevTxt = \"\";\n  for (const sec of f.sections) {\n    parts.push(`## ${sec.heading}`);\n    parts.push(\"\");\n    for (let p = sec.start; p <= sec.end; p++) {\n      const txt = cleanPageText(fkui[p - 1]);\n      if (txt && txt !== prevTxt) {\n        parts.push(`[Halaman PDF ${p}]`);\n        parts.push(txt);\n        parts.push(\"\");\n        prevTxt = txt;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  fs.writeFileSync(path.join(outDir, f.file), parts.join(\"\\n\"), \"utf8\");\n}\n\nconst mdFiles = fs.readdirSync(outDir).filter(n => n.endsWith(\".md\"));\nconsole.log(\"Generated markdown files:\", mdFiles.length);\n\'"
    shell_name: "bash"
  }
